  "rules": {
   "duration": "DurationMs/1000 * (DingShenDef * factor * (1 - RepeatedDef * repeatCount) + DingshenDefAddition) / 100, at least MinimalDurationMs; factor = BeImmobilizedConfig factorForBeAttacked[stiff level] while the victim plays a hit reaction (Beatback), else 1 (BUS_BeImmobilizedComp.OnTriggerImmobilize)",
   "frozen": "montage paused (snapshot pose), movement deactivated, BT/FSM/perception/hatred paused, sweep checks and attack warnings paused; CBG keeps polling (rules test simpleState Immobilizing)",
   "hit": "every hit: CurrentImmobilizeHP -= damage + ImmobilizeHit (0 for these skills); <= 0 -> ImmobilizedBreak: relieve, BreakEffects, break montage = normal stiff reaction of the hit's stiff level (lowest listed level when none) unless DisableImmobilizedBreakAnim (BUS_BeAttackedComp)",
